{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2205,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:19:08.099162479Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"37bee146-53be-55d3-9de7-1ef7e468724b","title":"[L063] Local checkpoints repeatedly serialize the complete growing archive index","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L063.\n\n- `local_context/memory/checkpoint.rs:49-56,87-98` stores the entire working-state snapshot, transcript manifest, and full `sources` vector as fresh content-addressed artifacts at every publication, together with the view, validation, and checkpoint manifest; six artifacts are pinned for each checkpoint event.\n- `memory/recovery.rs:20-44` materializes and verifies the whole aggregate before skipping events covered by the checkpoint, and restores the complete source index/state at lines 73-92. Replay rejects a source index at its 65,535-observation boundary at lines 188-195. Ingestion appends observations to the vector (`ingestion.rs:173-218`).\n- Structural persistent-session concern: growing snapshots and source indexes repeatedly consume artifact quota (L057) and recovery work. Catalog roots have no automatic expiry and referenced objects cannot be collected (L067). Exact journal-reference reclamation callers remain pending, so quadratic retained-byte growth is a source-derived risk rather than a measured live attribution.\n- `checkpoint.rs:98,115-118` commits the authoritative checkpoint first, then writes a trace observation. Trace failure therefore reports context failure even after durable checkpoint publication; later retry/recovery must reconcile those distinct commit boundaries.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBE+wXkzAC89fH6Oc1fp/vRf2IkTsziZJ/ZFWBcMGP2TnH3Ssa3WgDVMth3GeLOi6YNxZ2vnQ/GMzOHW7pFtUAI="}
