ave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: long productive read/write sessions through repeated compaction and segment boundaries, source/dependency changes, non-ASCII and large evidence, interrupted checkpoint publication, then reopen the same lineage and prove that valid grounding is reused and stale targets are reread. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:19:07.750Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDWFZHla2uK6QUAjZXGFG5HkDMFsvUciRab2YkyI/Q/CsA+W9VVSZ8pwMFtpeOjv6IfY38+5t51I/jhKEhprfgw="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2207,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:19:08.103256291Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"bf730116-0077-5793-b1e2-a7d3b6218607","title":"[L064] Transcript projection, pending operations, and observed-file counts","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L064.\n\n- `local_context/memory/ingestion.rs:221-230` rejects more than **4,096 message IDs**, **512 pending descriptors**, or **512 observed file paths** in its transcript projection. Begin clears current-input/message IDs for the next invocation but retains files and changes Proposed pending work to Unknown (lines 40-49).\n- Begin and recovery independently limit invocation-prefix text to **256 bytes** (`ingestion.rs:26-28`, `recovery.rs:118-123`). All full observations still consume the separate lifetime source count (L061/L063).\n- A tool observation without an exact durable proposal, conflicting identity, or noncontiguous tool sequence fails before incorporation (lines 135-159). These integrity checks are separate from finite count capacities. Pending settlement/retirement and file-list growth callers remain pending.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCXj+ZhUIs1cKq31duDSBbOnq5Ksk1FkLJbP9nZjIwVFHNYsTLGuuexfsem6STie8AEd0IJPMVDSB26ovm5VIQ8="}
