{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2213,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:19:08.115672777Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"57aa3c2d-e2dc-5f0a-be4a-9f161b5d38b5","title":"[L067] Referenced and quarantined artifacts keep consuming the logical quota","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L067.\n\n- `catalog.rs:103-115,313-318` sums all artifact-record sizes, including quarantined or corrupt records. Quarantine alone cannot free logical quota; SQLite's signed aggregate capacity is also finite (`catalog/value.rs:95-102`).\n- `catalog.rs:220-247` turns every durable reference into a GC root; the schema has no reference expiry and forbids deleting referenced metadata (`catalog/schema.rs:19-24`). Quarantine refuses referenced objects (`catalog.rs:337-342`), and deletion requires an unreferenced quarantined record (lines 358-383).\n- `gc_plan.rs:132-179` first quarantines an unmarked active object and deletes an unmarked quarantined object only in a **strictly later positive collection generation** (`verified.rs:31-39`). Marked quarantine is restored. These are explicit collection/integrity rules, not wall-clock session expiry.\n- Implication for persistent use: reclamation requires deliberate root retirement plus successive collection generations. The local publication path read so far pins six artifacts per checkpoint and does not perform that retirement/collection. Other application-level reference-release callers are still pending; no whole-program absence is claimed.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOGi/N3lJXuj6mFMCYu+SWHsOfRpryTrs3PG1tBzSsaJZfLkFahl5ty/9IfXXXXqPTv0U7dS5qjHoA9ww0gTAQE="}
