{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2227,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:19:08.145805409Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"84a0b553-1307-5af7-b865-be880fc15d68","title":"[L074] Working-event replay has a finite suffix size","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L074.\n\n- `working/event.rs:310-332` refuses replay input with more than `limits.observations()` events (**65,535** at standard limits), including non-observation refresh/delta/protocol events. This is a batch replay capacity in addition to lifetime observation admission.\n- Replay stops at the first invalid event (`346-369`), preserving error identity without skipping or repairing history. Application recovery currently read event-by-event; use of this batch API by other callers remains pending.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMcO9apHfXuN1OyFe2eVYvJdEXPLiAHx1AP24tt5nwhXrvKd2XD/q3mrvJ+Atru5SP+u0sesn2UILY637+r6hwU="}
