invariants together; a rejected new operation must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: large and multi-file candidates, repeated valid repair cycles, changed candidate facts, delayed reviews, local/offline verification, restart mid-gate and cancellation, proving correct repair handoff without accepting a failed candidate or rereading unchanged evidence forever. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:21:37.467Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFs6Bks60DMR/sftZKeY6HZ/l1RjsHLjLHhUSl53MyDsSSOUdhRCTpp33zRCM0euxGq0nckwYtoTMHpno8hhogU="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2311,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:21:37.628029051Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"c288e7c2-c8ae-567f-973e-bfef122425f1","title":"[L116] Restart resets every post-writing phase to checks and cannot restore private gate state","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L116.\n\n- `crates/app/peritus-product-runner/src/execution/resume/durable.rs:183-185,324-331` drops the private gate report and maps Checking, Reviewing, Fixing, Verifying, Finalizing and Complete to **Checking** on durable decode. Design and writer state are retained, but a report-only retry after process restart repeats deterministic checks; only an in-memory resume can retain Finalizing directly (`resume/tests.rs:43-67`).\n- Resume planning invalidates to Designing when design knowledge is not reusable, otherwise to Checking when any role knowledge was invalidated (`resume/knowledge.rs:58-88`). Its bindings carry **16 sections, 16 catalog sources, 8 source bindings per section and 8 direct dependencies per section** as static KnowledgeLimits arguments (`knowledge.rs:225-226`); `peritus-run-knowledge/src/limits.rs:34-62` confirms these constructor meanings; downstream enforcement is pending. The adapter creates only six sections/four sources, so these declarations do not prove a growing-session cap here.\n- Candidate reconciliation rejects a different run/workspace or backwards checkpoint sequence. Those lineage checks are necessary integrity fences. Durable restart preserves content/requirement evidence while reacquiring execution-bound evidence, as the read tests specify; tests were not executed during the audit.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvs