{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2337,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:21:37.691486378Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"f69bd9d8-3778-5fd3-b084-02d403b4184c","title":"[L129] Product reviewer admission caps each submission while conserved findings can keep accumulating","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L129.\n\n- `peritus-review/src/product/finding.rs:121-128,313-324` rejects any finding field above **64 KiB** or containing NUL, requires a nonzero cycle and nonempty title/description, and limits a submission to **128 findings** plus a nonempty **128 KiB summary**. Duplicate normalized finding identities reject the entire submission.\n- Identity at lines 366-371 is category plus trimmed/lowercased title; location is not included. Two distinct defects in different files with the same category/title therefore collide within one submission. This is normalization policy, not an elapsed limiter.\n- `product/ledger.rs:68-96` retains all prior findings without a corresponding 128-finding ledger ceiling or retirement; fresh submissions reconcile only the identities they contain. The reviewer prompt requires every still-present finding to be repeated (L125). Once more than 128 distinct findings remain, that instruction cannot be satisfied by one admitted submission. Rejection returns to the unlimited parse/grounding retry loop. This is a source-established count mismatch, not a measured live-run reproduction.\n- Cycles use `u32` and monotonicity compares `saturating_add(1)`; saturation is a representation boundary, not a configured daily-driving deadline. Durable restore retains finding history and coalesces old location-derived duplicates rather than expiring them.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAuA1M9+JN4M/qL0cZWcnbLFwoFSbQTJvjFvkQHDgPyu7MbzS0K/0PvkXcFvBxNpiDZGrvVgbmGGd1AoVH+LFQw="}
