{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2425,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:21:37.887244712Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"66bfc2de-dded-5d7c-931f-c12af50de2e5","title":"[L256] Lossless history is durable, but installation and replay repeatedly traverse complete state/history","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L256.\n\n- Source: `crates/state/peritus-journal/src/sqlite/history.rs`; `sqlite/history/node.rs`; `sqlite/query/state.rs`; `sqlite/query/aggregate.rs`.\n- History has **512-byte leaves**, **fanout 16**, maximum tree **level four**, and a logical value maximum of **16 MiB**. The leaf size is not an independent lifetime quota. At the 16 MiB value limit, installation visits 32768 leaf chunks plus their internal nodes. Every existing node is read and checked on each visit; content-addressed reuse avoids duplicate inserts but does not skip the full traversal.\n- Historical reads reconstruct the entire logical value and validate every visited node and producer event. Aggregate replay loads and validates every retained event through the exact head into a Vec. These adapters choose no elapsed timeout, but increasing session/state history entails synchronous work proportional to full retained data; they expose no incremental/page recovery for these operations.\n- Missing/damaged nodes, mismatched hashes, or absent producing events abort the requested history/replay. This is necessary integrity enforcement; daily-driving repair needs durable incremental verification and scoped recovery without turning one corrupted history row into an unexplained fresh context. Current callers and cross-subsystem failure consequences are tracked separately (including L198). **All named implementation files fully read; no timing benchmark or recovery reproduction performed.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFyxxy8Pux8wnV1MhhDSn1S3qSTD41G8P2gr8WU1FNxgXp/Rd9dEkDEG2hdnDiOV2D/7puCSA54XsSjpVerTAQc="}
